gstack-codex-auto is an original implementation of a Codex CLI development
controller. Its workflow is inspired by:

- loperanger7/gstack-auto: https://github.com/loperanger7/gstack-auto
- garrytan/gstack: https://github.com/garrytan/gstack

No upstream source files, prompt templates, UI assets, or binaries are included.
Locally installed gstack skills are optional external inputs, subject to their
own licenses and operating requirements. The MIT license in this repository
covers this project's original code and documentation only.

